**Verdict: Needs changes.** HIGH: 0 · MEDIUM: 6 · LOW: 0. [Full report](/Users/twocakes/Desktop/PROJECTS/timothyali2/docs/iterations/pixel-v2/125-design-audit/agents/codex-sol/report.md)

1. **Focus rings** fail contrast on inverted panels.
2. **Touch swatches** overlap and activate the wrong background.
3. **Phone sharing button** overflows at 320px and 390px.
4. **Lockup Continue** drops keyboard focus past Review.
5. **Mobile step buttons** lose their descriptive accessible names.
